+## v0.8 City Visual Overhaul
+- Denser 3D city generation with 300+ building objects and district-specific architecture.
+- Procedural facade textures with windows and night-time emission, rooftop equipment, balconies, shop fronts, public-building columns and landmarks.
+- Upgraded road presentation with wider roads/sidewalks, edge markings, crosswalks, traffic lights, street lights and street furniture.
+- Expanded vegetation, parks, fountains, riverfront details and moving boats.
+- Upgraded 3D cars/buses/service vehicles with wheels, glass, headlights and taillights.
+- Upgraded 3D citizens with limbs, clothing/height variation and walking animation.
+- Expanded city activity to 184 vehicles and 680 citizens with the existing banking UI preserved as an overlay.
+- Improved sky, filmic tone mapping and day/night lighting response.
